  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/490/316/pv_logo_long.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>讓村民更有效率！製作一個儲物站並放置在村民工作站的旁邊。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/622/pv_recipe.png\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/491/624/310/172/pv_setup.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>根據職業不同，將村民所需的物品放入儲物站。請參閱下方列表了解各職業的功能。可透過設定檔案停用或調整任務。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">更多村民</span>新增礦工與伐木工任務。分別給予綠寶石和鎬/斧頭。村民會隨時間開採附近礦石或木材。放置在資源密集區效果更佳。</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>已實裝村民任務與成本列表</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/847/a_stonecutter.png\">&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><strong>石匠</strong></strong></h4><p>處理多餘的開採材料</p><p>需要整組材料<br>回報取決於提供的岩石類型</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/857/a_toolsmith.png\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>工具匠</strong></h4><p>修復工具</p><p>每次修復花費1顆綠寶石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/858/a_grind.png\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>武器匠</strong></h4><p>修復劍與三叉戟</p><p>每次修復花費1顆綠寶石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/850/a_blast.png\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>盔甲匠</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>修復重甲</p><p>每次修復花費1顆綠寶石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/855/a_cauldron.png\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>皮匠</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>修復皮革盔甲</p><p>處理整組腐肉，提供皮革</p><p>每次修復花費1顆綠寶石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/852/a_compost.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>農夫</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>存放收成的作物</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/853/a_barrel.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>漁夫</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>捕魚與寶藏</p><p>需要釣竿</p><p>會保留部分漁獲</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/849/a_smoker.png\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>屠夫</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>人道地從生物收集肉類和其他物品（不殺生）</p><p>需要鐵斧</p><p>每次成功採集花費1顆綠寶石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/856/a_loom.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>牧羊人</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>剪羊毛</p><p>需要剪刀</p><p>每次成功採集花費1顆綠寶石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/851/a_cleric.png\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>牧師</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>治療附近村民或玩家</p><p>每次治療光環花費1顆綠寶石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/854/a_fletch.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>製箭師</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>修復弓與弩</p><p>每次修復花費1顆綠寶石</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
